hbo's new series the last of us has  begun filming in alberta canada we've  now got the first look at pedro pascal  as joel and bella ramsay's ellie as well  as set photos replicating key locations  from the games and new incomings for the  cast of the show a lot has happened  since the initial announcement of the  show back in 2020 so if there are gaps  in your knowledge or you're a last of us  mega fan looking for all the new  information we have about the classic  series then stay tuned  welcome back everyone to streaming the  galaxy my name is rocket riley and today  we're going to be going over everything  we know so far about hbo's upcoming  series the last of us based on the video  game series of the same name but before  we get started if you're new to the  channel please hit the subscribe button  and click the bell icon to be notified  when we upload a new video while we  don't have a release date for the last  of us series just yet we do have a few  details that give us an idea of when it  will be released  we know filming is already underway  because of videos and photos that have  been released from the series filming  location in calgary alberta one of the  show's directors kantamir balagov has  2022 listed as a release time on their  instagram page and one of the show's  leading actors gabriel luna recently  said in an interview i'm not in the  scheduling department but it'd be sooner  than later before we get to watch the  series  we're expecting production to last all  the way to the middle of 2022 which  means we shouldn't expect to see the  series hit hbo until the end of 2022  so far hbo has only given us a short  synopsis for the show the story takes  place 20 years after modern civilization  has been destroyed  joel a hardened survivor is hired to  smuggle ellie a 14 year old girl out of  an oppressive quarantine zone what  starts as a small job soon becomes a  brutal heartbreaking journey as they  both must traverse across the us and  depend on each other for survival  while this sounds like the main  storyline from the first video game  there are rumors that the show will also  include some of the events from the  second game  the first season is set to have 10  episodes and there have been talks about  a potential second season  it's not yet known if the first season  will cover all of the events of the  first last of us video game but with the  enhancements the directors are making to  the show i think it's likely that the  first season will only cover a portion  of the events of the first game going  more in depth into joel and tommy's past  much of the cast has already been  announced for this series featuring  pedro pascal as the show's protagonist  joel known for his work on game of  thrones and the mandalorian pedro pascal  has already been given the seal of  approval by joel's original voice actor  troy baker saying this is the way full  support full stop can't wait for you to  show me a side of joel i never knew  pedro  the show will also feature bella ramsay  known for her role as lady liana mormont  in game of thrones ramsay will take on  the starring role of ellie a character  known for her fierceness and intensity  just as lady mormont was in game of  thrones  although pascal and ramsay's characters  never interacted in the game of thrones  series i have no doubt that these two  performers will go above and beyond our  expectations for the show  several other characters have been  announced for the series as well  gabriel luna will play tommy and joel's  younger brother luna is known for his  work in terminator dark fate and true  detective meanwhile merle dandridge will  play the firefly's leader marlene just  as she did in the video game  nico parker will play joel's daughter  sarah as parker is known for her role in  tim burton's 2019 reimagining of dumbo  finally the most recent casting news is  that fringe star anna torv will be  playing tess joel's friend and fellow  smuggler who helped joel and ellie in  the first video game con o'neill will  play bill and murray bartlett is set to  play frank the pair are described as two  post-pandemic survivalists living alone  in their own isolated town  tommy's voice actor from the games  jeffrey pearce will play an original  character by the name of perry and one  mysterious character by the name of mr  adler will be played by brad leland  neil druckmann co-president and creative  director of naughty dog games the studio  that brought us the last of us and the  last of us two video games is rumored to  take on the helm of director for an  episode of the series alongside jasmila  zabonik kantamir balagov and ali abbasi  the video games composer gustavo santo  al-nala will be returning to score the  hbo series as well  the first official image of hbo's the  last of us tv show was released in late  september as part of naughty dog  celebration of the last of us day  several set photos and videos have also  been released by the residents of  calgary alberta showing pedro pascal and  bella ramsay on set along with anna torv  certain photos indicate the story's  location continuing in boston while  others display the continuation of the  savage starlight easter eggs found in  the video game  one photo released by gabriel luna on  social media shows tommy and joel before  the series outbreak potentially filming  the opening scene from the first video  game  every photo that gets released just  gives us further insight as to how  closely the show will be following the  storyline of the original video games  well that's gonna be everything from us  today on hbo's new series the last of us  if you enjoyed the video please hit the  like button and don't forget to  subscribe for more great content what  are your thoughts about the new set  photos and casting decisions made is  pedro pascal the right choice for joel  we'd like to know what you think so drop  your thoughts in the comment section  below  from everyone here at stream in the  galaxy we hope you have a great day and  thanks for watching
 

